
# These are the possible options. Normally any scanner
# should work just fine without them - and they are only
# needed for test and debugging. So if you experience problems
# and you solve them with enabling options here, please notify
# the SANE/Avision maintainer: Mike Kelly <mike@piratehaven.org>

#option disable-gamma-table
#option disable-calibration
#option force-a4

# Ignore the ADF, for scanners that report one when none is fitted
#option skip-adf

# Konica Minolta Dimage Scan Dual IV: firmware file to upload when the
# scanner asks for one after losing mains power. Not needed: without it
# the scanner's built-in firmware is used. SANE does not provide this file.
#option firmware @DATADIR@/sane/avision/dimage-scan-dual-iv.bin

#scsi AVISION
#scsi FCPA
#scsi MINOLTA
#scsi MITSBISH MCA-S600C
#scsi MITSBISH MCA-SS600
#scsi HP
#scsi hp

#scsi /dev/scanner
# usb libusb:002:003
# usb 0x03f0 0x0701
